@startuml F3.6-D03-arquivar-estagio
title F3.6-D03 — Arquivar estágio concluído
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "InternshipController" as Ctrl
participant "CloseInternshipUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Arquivar estágio
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /estagios/{id}/encerrar
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  docs obrigatórios APROVADO;
  senão 422 documents_pending
end note
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE CONCLUIDO\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: estágio CONCLUIDO

@enduml
